export function invoke<T extends {"parse":Function}>(target:T,arg0:()=>Parameters<Extract<T["parse"],(...args:any[])=>any>>[0]):ReturnType<Extract<T["parse"],(...args:any[])=>any>> { return target["parse"](arg0()) }
}
